 "id": "01a10749-b0f6-77b1-8976-a612f94d53a0",
 "content": "Run `make test-fast` for the unit suite (skips the Postgres and network integration tests). `make test` runs everything but needs `docker compose up db` first. The FX tests also need generated fixtures: run `python scripts/gen_fx_fixtures.py` once (writes gitignored tests/fixtures/fx/*.json from the committed CSVs), and run tests with `LEDGERLINE_FX_FIXTURES=tests/fixtures/fx` set \u2014 otherwise test_currency errors with KeyError/FileNotFoundError at setup (see docs/testing.md)."
}

